# --- QQ / 腾讯系广告 ---
腾讯新闻_开屏与信息流显式广告 = type=http-response,pattern=^https:\/\/(?:news\.ssp\.qq\.com\/app|r\.inews\.qq\.com\/(?:getQQNewsUnreadList|getTagFeedList|news_feed\/hot_module_list|gw\/page\/(?:event_detail|channel_feed)))(?:\?|$),requires-body=1,max-size=1048576,timeout=5,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STERILITZIA02/Blockad-sr-my/main/dist/scripts/blockad-router.js

